==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/klɪk/}}
* {{audio|en|En-au-klick.ogg|Audio (AU)}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-klick.oga|Audio (US)}}
* {{homophones|en|click|clique}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪk}}

===Etymology 1===
* Most likely a pseudo-condensed pronunciation of {{m|en|kilometer}}, being a suitably short word emphasizing {{m|en|k}}+{{m|en|l}} instead of /keɪ/ alone (the same principle as with military [[spelling alphabet]]s, but also clearly distinguished from {{m|en|kilo}} (/kiːloʊ/) for {{m|en|kilogram}}).
* Possibly onomatopoeic of the sound of a military odometer.

